  "notes": "{監視|かんし} means surveillance, monitoring, or watching over something/someone.\n\nKANJI BREAKDOWN:\n- {監|かん}: oversee, supervise\n- {視|し}: look, watch\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {監視|かんし}する: to monitor, to surveil\n- {監視|かんし}カメラ: surveillance camera\n- {監視|かんし}{下|か}に{置|お}く: to put under surveillance\n- {監視|かんし}{体制|たいせい}: monitoring system\n- {監視|かんし}{員|いん}: guard, watchman\n\nCONTEXTS:\n- Security: {防犯|ぼうはん}{監視|かんし} (crime prevention monitoring)\n- Medical: {患者|かんじゃ}の{監視|かんし} (patient monitoring)\n- IT: システム{監視|かんし} (system monitoring)",
